                        "review": "Honestly cannot recommend this game. The combat is clunky, tiresome, and repetitive - and pets wanting to immediately trigger mimics when you enter a room basically makes them useless. The item shop gameplay is not super great or deep. Every unlock so far has been uninteresting.\r\n\r\nThe worst part? The bugs. Sound will randomly cut out. Change the controls and suddenly you can't interact with books/interactables because it still wants you to use the old button which also doesn't work because [i]it's not the interact button anymore[/i].\r\n\r\nAdd on the fact they've released DLC [b]and a sequel[/b] without previously fixing their still-broken game, and it just feels like an extra slap in the face. This game feels like an early-access beta, but they've gone and worked on a sequel instead.\r\n\r\nMaybe the sequel is better, but I've certainly got no faith they'll fix the bugs nor make interesting gameplay there neither.",
